ceptance Criteria\n\n- A validated configuration path exists for using an external, user-provided PostgreSQL/pgvector\n  instance with a playground OGX instance (OGXServer spec with user-supplied connection details\n  via secret).\n- Gen AI Studio Playground RAG workflows function against the user-provided store via the remote\n  pgvector vector_io provider with no loss of current capability for users who complete the setup.\n- Setup documentation exists covering secret creation, the OGXServer spec fields, enabling the\n  pgvector vector_io provider, and reverting the configuration; the documentation is technically\n  reviewed against the validated configuration.\n- OGX application storage remains on the SQLite default; only the vector_io provider configuration\n  changes.\n- The manual-setup limitation versus the out-of-the-box experience is documented and communicated\n  as a release note item.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **AC-2 (Playground RAG workflows function, no loss of capability)** — satisfied for users who\n  provision and configure their own store.\n- **AC-4 (separate process, decoupled from the OGX instance)** — the store is an external\n  user-provided PostgreSQL process.\n- **AC-1 (out-of-the-box, no manual provisioning)** — **not satisfied by this branch**; this is the\n  documented degraded fallback (see the decomposition summary's health warnings). Recorded here so\n  reviewers see the gap is analyzed rather than missed.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":78820,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a69fe9ec9252deb2","agent_id":"a890b7bc884117537","session_id":"b07b26f1-905e-4b64-8357-872b48ad7853","uuid":"73763791-0319-4e95-9621-84b4a38052ea","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:25:48.012Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8004"}
